  "prompt": "Trong mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, cho ba điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>P</mi></semantics></math> được biểu diễn như Hình 5.\n\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/64fc56b2e19c12c1d8a82c21eba05db8c99eec5087fa042fd57645978989adfa.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Tìm tọa độ các điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Hãy biểu diễn các véc-tơ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> qua hai véc-tơ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>i</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>j</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>.</li><li>Tìm tọa độ các véc-tơ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
