  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Theo Hình 5 ta có toạ độ các điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>P</mi></semantics></math> lần lượt là: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>;<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>;\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có: \t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>;<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>;<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>O</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>;<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
